Case 1: Tweet Content. User A loves Twitter and tweets about 50 times a day. Since it's an account where they only interact with online friends, they posted frankly about school complaints and girls they were interested in.

97
00:17:05,588 --> 00:17:36,368
ネタツイートをするのも好きで、昨日つぶやいたネタツイが初めて万バズし、誇らしげなAさんが朝教室に入ると「このアカウントお前だろな？」と声をかけられ、画面を見るとそれは自分のアカウントでした。
They also liked posting joke tweets, and yesterday's joke tweet went viral for the first time. Proudly walking into the classroom, A was approached and asked, "Isn't this account yours?" Looking at the screen, it turned out to be their own account.

98
