if a few classmates follow them, you think, "Ah, must be someone, wonder who," and furthermore, since an acquaintance is there, and the profile says Cover High School and lists the same grade level, you might end up thinking, "Oh, could it be Melacchi from the same class?", the possibility is there. If it's an acquaintance, you accept them.

