[Text: Things to Watch Out For! Summary
- Be careful with what you post on SNS (photos and text information)
  Know beforehand what might be dangerous
- When making a locked account, connect with other locked accounts
  Avoid names and icons that draw unwanted attention
- Make passwords complex
  Always suspect you're being targeted and secure your accounts
- When meeting people from the internet, go in groups and in crowded places]

